    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, frantic, and stylish</strong>, <i>Blitzstrike\u00a0</i>blends tight 2D gunplay with cinematic moments, hidden paths, and an explosive climax. It\u2019s a short, sweet, sharp blast of arcade action designed to be beaten in under an hour\u2014but packed with enough secrets and style to keep speedrunners and explorers coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/501c5f75491e959a85829b6a0aa16ba2.avif?t=1752612884\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blitzstrike</strong>, you are Trixel \u2014 a pink-haired, trigger-happy bounty hunter with a sharp tongue, sharper reflexes, and zero patience for standing still. When a mysterious threat resurfaces, Trixel is thrust into a high-speed, high-stakes mission across a green-lit neon city, a sky-high bridge, and rooftops that barely hold beneath her boots. Along the way, she faces off against deadly bots, tight spaces, and a vicious threat who might just be her deadliest rival\u2014or her only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/902fffa88791d144743094afcd928620.avif?t=1752612884\" width=128 height=192 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/a55919d941673ddb2e981af96bdcef69.avif?t=1752612884\" width=192 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-tight 2D Gunplay</strong> \u2013 Fire fast, dash faster. Precision controls that reward quick thinking and quicker fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality-Driven Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Sharp sprites, expressive animations, and sass by the pixel-load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Battles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Face off in high-stakes showdowns packed with story and style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Friendly</strong> \u2013 Designed for repeat runs, with hidden paths, and a<strong> Speedrun Arena</strong> bonus mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Works great with Steam Deck, plug-and-play with your favorite gamepad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Localized</strong> \u2013 English, French, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional CRT Filter</strong> \u2013 Add retro flair with an optional scanline and color shader for that old-school vibe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, frantic, and stylish</strong>, <i>Blitzstrike\u00a0</i>blends tight 2D gunplay with cinematic moments, hidden paths, and an explosive climax. It\u2019s a short, sweet, sharp blast of arcade action designed to be beaten in under an hour\u2014but packed with enough secrets and style to keep speedrunners and explorers coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/501c5f75491e959a85829b6a0aa16ba2.avif?t=1752612884\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blitzstrike</strong>, you are Trixel \u2014 a pink-haired, trigger-happy bounty hunter with a sharp tongue, sharper reflexes, and zero patience for standing still. When a mysterious threat resurfaces, Trixel is thrust into a high-speed, high-stakes mission across a green-lit neon city, a sky-high bridge, and rooftops that barely hold beneath her boots. Along the way, she faces off against deadly bots, tight spaces, and a vicious threat who might just be her deadliest rival\u2014or her only way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/902fffa88791d144743094afcd928620.avif?t=1752612884\" width=128 height=192 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654000/extras/a55919d941673ddb2e981af96bdcef69.avif?t=1752612884\" width=192 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-tight 2D Gunplay</strong> \u2013 Fire fast, dash faster. Precision controls that reward quick thinking and quicker fingers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality-Driven Pixel Art</strong> \u2013 Sharp sprites, expressive animations, and sass by the pixel-load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Battles\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Face off in high-stakes showdowns packed with story and style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun Friendly</strong> \u2013 Designed for repeat runs, with hidden paths, and a<strong> Speedrun Arena</strong> bonus mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Controller Support</strong> \u2013 Works great with Steam Deck, plug-and-play with your favorite gamepad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Localized</strong> \u2013 English, French, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional CRT Filter</strong> \u2013 Add retro flair with an optional scanline and color shader for that old-school vibe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Blitzstrike is a fast-paced 2D action-platformer where you play as Trixel, a sharp-tongued bounty hunter on a mission through a futuristic city and enemy-filled corridors, culminating in a dramatic showdown with her greatest threat yet.",
